        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSB4060, 4\" x 6\" Wide Throw Hinge Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeltana's newest addition to their solid brass hinge line is a 4 inch by 6 inch wide throw hinge that is 0.129 inches thick. Wide throw hinges are wider than they are high to move the barrel away from the face of the door.  Wide throw hinges are necessary when additional throw is required to clear decorative trim or wall conditions.  Available in unlacquered brass or oil rubbed bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a set of two hinges and wood screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSB4060-specifications.gif?v=1718159558\" width=\"522\" height=\"444\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSPA4060 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Wide Throw Hinge 4\" x 6\":\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness (gauge): 0.129\"</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12 x 1/2</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise</li>\r\n\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSB4060.pdf?v=1718159599\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSB4060 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
